<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts HealthCare Financial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts HealthCare Financial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it expects HealthCare Financial Partners Inc to earn $0.78 a share in 1997 and $1.05 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Lehman said earlier it initiated coverage of the stock with a buy rating and set a 12-month price target of $30 a share.</p>
<p>-- HealthCare Financial gained 3/8 to 22-3/8.</p>
</text>
